{"id":"mayori_a","lemma":"mayoría","pos":"noun","rank":684,"glosses":["majority"],"ipa":"/maʝoˈɾia/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mayorías"},"order":855,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-mayor%C3%ADa.wav","examples":[{"text":"La mayoría de la gente es idiota.","en":"Most people are idiots.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460902","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"people"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"idiot"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"La mayoría de ello está en francés.","en":"Most of it's in French.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302495","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"French"}]},{"text":"La mayoría nunca se equivoca.","en":"The majority is never wrong.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/694600","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"never"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to mistake, mix up","l":"equivocar"}]}]}